{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-06-27 16:43:00', 'title': 'PNC ANNOUNCES STRESS CAPITAL BUFFER (SCB)', 'text': "PITTSBURGH , JUNE 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP, INC. (NYSE: PNC) LAST WEEK RECEIVED THE RESULTS OF THE FEDERAL RESERVE'S 2022 COMPREHENSIVE CAPITAL ANALYSIS AND REVIEW (CCAR).\xa0 THE FEDERAL RESERVE'S CCAR DISCLOSURE INCLUDED ITS ESTIMATE OF PNC'S MINIMUM CAPITAL RATIOS FOR THE PERIOD FROM THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2022 THROUGH THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2024 UNDER THE HYPOTHETICAL SUPERVISORY SEVERELY ADVERSE SCENARIO."}